    "detailed_description": "Deep Blue Odyssey is a thrilling submarine running game that will test your reflexes and challenge your strategic thinking. As the captain of a state-of-the-art submersible vessel, you will need to navigate through treacherous waters, avoiding torpedoes and sea mines, while making sure you keep your vessel afloat. With simple one-touch controls, you can either ascend or descend in the water, but you must be careful not to drop too low or rise too high, or risk colliding with obstacles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you progress through the game, you will encounter various challenges, such as navigating through narrow channels, avoiding underwater obstacles, and outmaneuvering enemy submarines. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeep Blue Odyssey features stunning graphics and realistic sound effects that immerse you in the underwater world. With multiple levels of difficulty, you can challenge yourself to beat your previous high scores and unlock new achievements. So dive into the deep blue sea and embark on an unforgettable adventure in Deep Blue Odyssey!",
